/-- Full deduction of the manuscript's Proposition 5.1 from the explicit
source-level inputs above.  In particular the conclusion is the original
`Tasks.UniformAnchorSieve`, so all later density-zero and final-assembly code
uses the result with no additional Proposition-5.1 assumption. -/
